{"4060940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BUBBLE HEAVENS", "steam_appid": 4060940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUBBLE HEAVENS</strong> is a 3D Platformer with a great focus on speed, precision platforming and linear exploration! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit your way throught a world designed around cleanliness and domestic higyene, sliding, bumping, twirling and capturing enemies and objects with soap bubbles to advance in this crazy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game is the fact you <strong>play as The Bubbler</strong> - a character made of bubbles, who <strong>can stick to walls and slide onto them - mostly, what you will be doing is...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping, Sliding, Pursuing, Capturing, Protecting, Carrying, Avoiding obstacles, Twirling, and DANCING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubbler is a creature you control made of bubbles created by a great scientist of this world - as it progresses through natural environments that resembles domestic open-air rooms, it get to know this weird places and the people living in it - including some old family members who brings interesting discoveries around the true nature of this higyenist society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game with a narrative about fraternity, segregationism, higyene and health, and innoccence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUBBLE HEAVENS</strong> is a 3D Platformer with a great focus on speed, precision platforming and linear exploration! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit your way throught a world designed around cleanliness and domestic higyene, sliding, bumping, twirling and capturing enemies and objects with soap bubbles to advance in this crazy universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heart of the game is the fact you <strong>play as The Bubbler</strong> - a character made of bubbles, who <strong>can stick to walls and slide onto them - mostly, what you will be doing is...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping, Sliding, Pursuing, Capturing, Protecting, Carrying, Avoiding obstacles, Twirling, and DANCING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bubbler is a creature you control made of bubbles created by a great scientist of this world - as it progresses through natural environments that resembles domestic open-air rooms, it get to know this weird places and the people living in it - including some old family members who brings interesting discoveries around the true nature of this higyenist society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short game with a narrative about fraternity, segregationism, higyene and health, and innoccence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play as The Bubbler on an emotional journey through a surreal world based on hygiene and cleanliness - jump, stick to walls, slide, clean and RUN as you uncover the secrets of a higyenist society!", "supported_languages": "English, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/48eb76e6967ca701984d54b1903ab74ce01103d5/header.jpg?t=1773528012", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/05ba090b166816d0c57cfadd8050beff28cfc438/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773528012", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060940/05ba090b166816d0c57cfadd8050beff28cfc438/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773528012", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum